1) Input the name of the game;
2) Choose the game mode;
3) Click CREATE;
4) Wait for your friends or other players to join the lobby;
5) When there are enough players, click PLAY

If you want to join someone else's game, then:

1) Click the UPDATE button in the game browser;
2) Select a game from the list and click on its title (join);
